      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm all for more size support, though in the opposite end of the spectrum.  I would like to know more of what you're exactly proposing.  What are you asking to be improved?  I have alot of friends who use small avatars, and I have used one on occasion, but never had an issue.",
