      "value": "Sorry for the late night ramblings. I tried to note I can't access the camera so I wanted to be able to access that as a small avatar with blue lasers & such from a distance. I then tried to tack on some \"fluff\" text saying it would then benefit other sized avatars & etc. \n\nJust \"something\" for various avatar sizes because not everybody will be small, or large avatars. Even in between.",
