      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Wanting to note that the camera appears below the ground when you're a small avatar that I would love it to be at eye level. VR cameras should spawn at eye level, not below the ground when you're a tiny avatar. I had to go to the edge of something to rope in both the normal & streaming camera. \n(Wanting to edit this into my main posting)",
